  "label": "The Shiba Inu dog is mapped as the speaker of the text",
  "description": "The text 'I'm not transphobic i just don't like 'em' is superimposed on the image of the Shiba Inu dog. The dog's smug and dismissive expression visually represents the speaker of the text, implying that the dog is the entity making this statement. This is an analogical mapping where the visual entity (Shiba Inu dog) is projected as the textual entity (the speaker of the message).",
